@Chuck.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5075
@pin = 1234
@fileId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@burnToken = sample-burn-token-guid

@passcode = SecretCode123

### 0. Query Instance Security Configuration
GET {{Chuck.API_HostAddress}}/api/config
Accept: application/json

### 0a. Verify Instance Passcode (JSON Payload)
POST {{Chuck.API_HostAddress}}/api/config/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passcode": "{{passcode}}"
}

### 0b. Verify Instance Passcode (HTTP Header)
POST {{Chuck.API_HostAddress}}/api/config/verify
X-Instance-Passcode: {{passcode}}

### 1. Create a Drop (Multipart: Text Payload, Expiry Duration & Attached File)
POST {{Chuck.API_HostAddress}}/api/drops
X-Instance-Passcode: {{passcode}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="TextPayload"

Hello from Chuck HTTP test!
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ExpiryMinutes"

10
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Files"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is a test file payload transferred via Chuck.
--boundary--

### 2. Retrieve Drop Metadata by PIN
GET {{Chuck.API_HostAddress}}/api/drops/{{pin}}
X-Instance-Passcode: {{passcode}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Download Individual File Stream
GET {{Chuck.API_HostAddress}}/api/drops/{{pin}}/files/{{fileId}}
X-Instance-Passcode: {{passcode}}

### 4. Download All Files as an Uncompressed ZIP Archive
GET {{Chuck.API_HostAddress}}/api/drops/{{pin}}/zip?token=dl_token_123
X-Instance-Passcode: {{passcode}}

### 5. Poll In-Flight ZIP Download Status
GET {{Chuck.API_HostAddress}}/api/drops/status/dl_token_123
X-Instance-Passcode: {{passcode}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Burn Individual File
DELETE {{Chuck.API_HostAddress}}/api/drops/{{pin}}/files/{{fileId}}
X-Instance-Passcode: {{passcode}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Cancel Drop (Pre-Retrieval Sender Revocation via Burn Token)
DELETE {{Chuck.API_HostAddress}}/api/drops/{{pin}}?token={{burnToken}}
X-Instance-Passcode: {{passcode}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Burn Entire Drop (Recipient Atomic Obliteration)
DELETE {{Chuck.API_HostAddress}}/api/drops/{{pin}}
X-Instance-Passcode: {{passcode}}
Accept: application/json
